    "description": "Your daily companion for sustainable, convenient, and cost-effective transport. Whether it\u2019s the rush hour commute, a tour of the town, or those last-mile connections; every journey is a step towards a greener tomorrow.\r\n\r\nReady to Hopp? It's as simple as A.B.C\r\n\r\n- App: Download the app now to find your ride\r\n- Billing - Easily add a credit card or register with Apple/Google Pay\r\n- Controls - Take a moment to read through the in-app onboarding instructions. Safety first!\r\n\r\nDownload now to help lessen congestion and be the solution to pollution.\r\n\r\nGo further with Hopp",
